    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "tb-join-why",
        "moduleId": "why-wait",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材：为什么需要等待线程完成",
        "markdown": "线程创建后，主线程若需要在线程结束之后才继续，就必须主动等待它完成。教材指出，仅仅创建线程并不会让调用者停下来；必须调用 `pthread_join()` 才能等待指定线程终止，并在该线程结束后取回它交出的结果。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-98b367ee24452fe791591fee",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000347"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关于内存虚拟化的对话",
                "线程完成"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6247,
              "lineEnd": 6344,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "21430f9b613c6844aaf9b037ceba910a0bffc13956ff78c8f384410e6b9b4a3c"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-join-analogy",
        "moduleId": "why-wait",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充：join 像等同伴交回结果",
        "markdown": "可以把 `pthread_join()` 想成在约定地点等一位同伴：同伴（工作线程）在别处完成任务，等待者（通常是主线程）在 join 处停住，直到对方带着结果回来。这个类比的关键是两件事同时发生——等待者被阻塞，结果通过事先约定好的位置交回。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-join-why"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-join-signature",
        "moduleId": "join-interface",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "教材：pthread_join 的两个参数",
        "markdown": "`pthread_join()` 接收两个参数：\n\n1. 一个 `pthread_t`，指定要等待的线程。该值由 `pthread_create()` 初始化，创建时把指针传给它，之后保留即可用于等待。\n2. 一个指针，指向你希望取回的返回值。由于线程函数可以返回任意类型，返回值被定义为 `void *`；又因为 `pthread_join()` 会修改这个位置的内容，所以要传入指向返回值的指针，而不是返回值本身。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-98b367ee24452fe791591fee",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000347"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关于内存虚拟化的对话",
                "线程完成"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6247,
              "lineEnd": 6344,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "21430f9b613c6844aaf9b037ceba910a0bffc13956ff78c8f384410e6b9b4a3c"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-pointer-reason",
        "moduleId": "join-interface",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充：第二个参数为什么是指针的指针",
        "markdown": "线程函数签名是 `void *f(void *)`，它交回的值本身就是一个 `void *`。调用者需要让 `pthread_join()` 把这个 `void *` 写回自己的变量，因此传给 join 的是存放该 `void *` 的地址，形如 `void **`。这解释了教材中 `Pthread_join(p, (void **) &m)` 的强制转换：`m` 是 `myret_t *`，它的地址就是存放返回值的地址。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-join-signature"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-return-struct-example",
        "moduleId": "return-value-patterns",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "教材：用结构体打包参数与返回值（图 27.2）",
        "markdown": "```c\ntypedef struct { int a; int b; } myarg_t;\ntypedef struct { int x; int y; } myret_t;\n\nvoid *mythread(void *arg) {\n    myarg_t *m = (myarg_t *) arg;\n    myret_t *r = Malloc(sizeof(myret_t));\n    r->x = 1;\n    r->y = 2;\n    return (void *) r;\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    pthread_t p;\n    myret_t *m;\n    myarg_t args = { 10, 20 };\n    Pthread_create(&p, NULL, mythread, &args);\n    Pthread_join(p, (void **) &m);\n    return 0;\n}\n```\n\n线程结束时主线程已经在 `pthread_join()` 中等待；join 返回后即可读取 `myret_t` 中的内容。教材同时指出：不需要参数时创建线程传 `NULL`，不需要返回值时 join 也传 `NULL`。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-98b367ee24452fe791591fee",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000347"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关于内存虚拟化的对话",
                "线程完成"
              ],
              "lineStart": 6247,
              "lineEnd": 6344,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "21430f9b613c6844aaf9b037ceba910a0bffc13956ff78c8f384410e6b9b4a3c"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-join-flow",
        "moduleId": "return-value-patterns",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "procedure",
        "title": "补充：一次 join 的完整时序",
        "markdown": "1. `pthread_create` 初始化 `pthread_t`，工作线程开始运行。\n2. 主线程调用 `pthread_join`，进入阻塞等待。\n3. 工作线程返回一个 `void *` 并终止。\n4. join 把返回值写入第二个参数指向的位置，并唤醒主线程。\n5. 主线程解引用该位置，读取结构体字段。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "tb-join-signature",
            "tb-return-struct-example"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "tb-simple-int-example",
        "moduleId": "return-value-patterns",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "code",
        "title": "教材：只传一个整数时的简化写法（图 27.3）",
        "markdown": "```c\nvoid *mythread(void *arg) {\n    int m = (int) arg;\n    return (void *) (arg + 1);\n}\n\nint main(void) {\n    pthread_t p;\n    int m;\n    Pthread_create(&p, NULL, mythread, (void *) 100);\n    Pthread_join(p, (void **) &m);\n    return 0;\n}\n```\n\n当参数和返回值都只是一个整数时，不必再打包成结构体：创建时把整数强制转成 `void *` 传入，返回时把结果同样转回 `void *`，join 后再从 `int` 变量中读出。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-98b367ee24452fe791591fee",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000347"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "关于内存虚拟化的对话",
